        ('PG-U01','understand','追踪调用优先级和无结果实现','Trace the complete plugin registration case and separate execution order from collected results. No edits.',['materials/order.md'],'explained','Results are first:X,B:X,A:X; ordinary hooks run in reverse registration order within their priority,with tryfirst before and trylast after. Last still executes but its None is omitted. Do not promise alphabetical or arbitrary dependency-graph ordering.',['ordinary_hooks_use_declared_priority_and_drop_only_none_results']),
        ('PG-C01','consult','为首个结果协议保留合法假值','Meet the complete choice requirement with current firstresult behavior and an explicit None policy. No implementation.',['materials/first.md'],'advice_no_code_change','firstresult stops on False and integer0 and returns each unchanged. Only None permits fallback,which runs once for the None control. A plugin must returnNone for no decision; Python falsiness is not the protocol stop condition.',['firstresult_stops_on_false_and_zero_but_not_none']),
        ('PG-U02','understand','追踪协议默认参数和兼容实现','Trace the complete default and explicit-prefix calls and explain current signature compatibility. No edits.',['materials/defaults.md'],'explained','The fuller implementation receives APP by spec default and EXPLICIT on explicit override; the shorter implementation receives only value and still works. Results retain normal order. Protocol default values and accepted argument pruning support compatible evolution; do not insist all signatures are identical or claim the implementation PLUGIN default wins over the spec default.',['spec_defaults_and_argument_pruning_support_compatible_implementations']),
        ('PG-C02','consult','在初始化阶段显式核未知钩子','Advise initialization validation from the complete ordinary/optional controls without edits or distribution discovery.',['materials/pending.md'],'advice_no_code_change','Unknown marked hook registration can succeed and check_pending later raises PluginValidationError; an explicitly optional hook passes that check. Add the intended specs/use matching markers and run deliberate pending validation before use. optionalhook is a conscious compatibility policy,not a blanket way to hide mistakes.',['unknown_hook_validation_is_explicit_and_optional_is_deliberate']),
        ('PG-U03','understand','按报告排除插件而不改变注册表','Meet the complete subset requirement with actual existing calls and registry observations. No edits.',['materials/subset.md'],'explained','The subset returnsA:X while the full hook still returnsB:X,A:X and B remains registered. subset_hook_caller is a call-specific exclusion view,not unregister or a global mode change. Use that current scoped API instead of inventing registry mutation.',['subset_call_does_not_unregister_or_mutate_the_full_hook']),
